# Passing Glory (ToAU 18). The must-zone var set: Naja's trigger three times (the Option var's dialog cycle); the
# trigger area 3. A rezone (it clears the var), the Timer in the future: Naja and the area; the Timer 0: the area
# plays 3090; its update with options 0 and 1; finished: completed.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/3 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventUpdate/3090 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3090
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau PassingGlory current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
charvar Mission[4][17]mustZone 1
trigger Naja_Salaheem
finish-if-event
trigger Naja_Salaheem
finish-if-event
trigger Naja_Salaheem
finish-if-event
walk 34.7,-6.6,-54.1
walk 34.7,-6.6,-40
rezone
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
charvar Mission[4][17]Timer 999999999
trigger Naja_Salaheem
finish-if-event
walk 34.7,-6.6,-54.1
walk 34.7,-6.6,-40
charvar Mission[4][17]Timer 0
walk 34.7,-6.6,-54.1
update 3090 option=0
update 3090 option=1
finish
